{
  "type": "minecraft:multi_action",
  "title": "草人杯 · 地图传送",
  "external_title": "地图传送",
  "columns": 1,
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "选择要前往的地图。\n",
          "color": "white"
        },
        {
          "text": "这套服同一时刻只加载一张地图，所以切换地图 = 服务端重启：所有人会断开约 30 秒，重启后重新连接即可进入新地图。\n\n",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "只有管理员（OP）可以执行切换；其他人点了会看到权限提示。",
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "label": { "text": "坐垫战争（回合制 A）", "color": "aqua" },
      "action": { "type": "minecraft:run_command", "command": "/maps goto cushion-wars" }
    },
    {
      "label": { "text": "查看当前在哪张地图", "color": "white" },
      "action": { "type": "minecraft:run_command", "command": "/maps list" }
    }
  ]
}
